    "burrow dug beneath the clearing and followed the straight route on his map. the soil stayed firm and easy at first. then his shovel struck something hard": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-dug-beneath-the-clearing-and-followed-the-straight-route-on-his-map-the-soil-stayed-firm-and-easy-at-first-then-his-shovel-struck-something-hard-4311de5c6f.mp3",
    "burrow dug carefully around the wooden edge instead of striking it again. soon, a small hidden underground door appeared between hollow oak's thick roots": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-dug-carefully-around-the-wooden-edge-instead-of-striking-it-again-soon-a-small-hidden-underground-door-appeared-between-hollow-oak-s-thick-roots-e88afa23dc.mp3",
    "burrow dug carefully beneath the floor while pip followed the trembling root. soon they uncovered a buried branch tugging a second rope. that rope led upward": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-dug-carefully-beneath-the-floor-while-pip-followed-the-trembling-root-soon-they-uncovered-a-buried-branch-tugging-a-second-rope-that-rope-led-upward-25437e0634.mp3",
    "burrow examined the notch luna had found. it was just wide enough for one digging claw. he pressed his claw inside, and a wooden latch clicked behind the door": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-examined-the-notch-luna-had-found-it-was-just-wide-enough-for-one-digging-claw-he-pressed-his-claw-inside-and-a-wooden-latch-clicked-behind-the-door-822b695dd6.mp3",
    "burrow followed the carved trees around the wall. some were tiny shoots; others spread tall branches. he tried both directions, but could not find where hollow oak's story began": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-followed-the-carved-trees-around-the-wall-some-were-tiny-shoots-others-spread-tall-branches-he-tried-both-directions-but-could-not-find-where-hollow-oak-s-story-began-d1f3902f92.mp3",
    "burrow followed the glowing line to a huge tree around a little round doorway. \"that is hollow oak,\" he said. \"it grew around the rabbit's front door.\" luna nodded": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-followed-the-glowing-line-to-a-huge-tree-around-a-little-round-doorway-that-is-hollow-oak-he-said-it-grew-around-the-rabbit-s-front-door-luna-nodded-69167e9281.mp3",
    "burrow gathered his friends around hollow oak's table and showed them a sketch of the hidden door. together, they planned how to inspect it safely": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-gathered-his-friends-around-hollow-oak-s-table-and-showed-them-a-sketch-of-the-hidden-door-together-they-planned-how-to-inspect-it-safely-8907f4efdd.mp3",
    "burrow held the dull stone up to the light. \"where did you keep it while you climbed?\" he asked. pip looked down at the pocket on his belt": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-held-the-dull-stone-up-to-the-light-where-did-you-keep-it-while-you-climbed-he-asked-pip-looked-down-at-the-pocket-on-his-belt-50588f3aa1.mp3",
    "burrow leaned against the mushroom and began to snore. pip gathered the boots beside him. glimmer kept watch while pip moved the biscuit bowl out of reach": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-leaned-against-the-mushroom-and-began-to-snore-pip-gathered-the-boots-beside-him-glimmer-kept-watch-while-pip-moved-the-biscuit-bowl-out-of-reach-ffee7f7588.mp3",
    "burrow looked from the old carving to the tunnel he had dug. he brushed earth from his paws. \"i hope my doorway lasts that long,\" he said": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/burrow-looked-from-the-old-carving-to-the-tunnel-he-had-dug-he-brushed-earth-from-his-paws-i-hope-my-doorway-lasts-that-long-he-said-01e267e61d.mp3",
