    "fern lifted the wet leaves. small gold-green shoots glowed underneath, and their new roots hummed together. she called for luna, keeping her hands clear of the delicate stems": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-lifted-the-wet-leaves-small-gold-green-shoots-glowed-underneath-and-their-new-roots-hummed-together-she-called-for-luna-keeping-her-hands-clear-of-the-delicate-stems-792dbdd6fa.mp3",
    "fern looked around, then noticed the spectacles resting on twig's head. 'they are above your ears,' she said gently. twig reached up and laughed": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-looked-around-then-noticed-the-spectacles-resting-on-twig-s-head-they-are-above-your-ears-she-said-gently-twig-reached-up-and-laughed-e1afdfc22c.mp3",
    "fern looped a strong green vine around the boulder and pulled from the bank. at the same time, dewdrop sent a steady current underneath it": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-looped-a-strong-green-vine-around-the-boulder-and-pulled-from-the-bank-at-the-same-time-dewdrop-sent-a-steady-current-underneath-it-e799078c67.mp3",
