    "fern sang one calm note and waited for the root to relax. instead, the root copied her sound by curling into one new loop. fern stared": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/fern-sang-one-calm-note-and-waited-for-the-root-to-relax-instead-the-root-copied-her-sound-by-curling-into-one-new-loop-fern-stared-9efbe845a6.mp3",
