    "glimmer leaned over the table and blew cinnamon warmth across the top paper star. warm air brushed its points. luna watched the stack carefully": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/glimmer-leaned-over-the-table-and-blew-cinnamon-warmth-across-the-top-paper-star-warm-air-brushed-its-points-luna-watched-the-stack-carefully-0953d84440.mp3",
