    "glimmer nudged the charts aside. \"can your spell lift just a boot?\" they asked. spark looked down at his feet and slowly raised one knee": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/glimmer-nudged-the-charts-aside-can-your-spell-lift-just-a-boot-they-asked-spark-looked-down-at-his-feet-and-slowly-raised-one-knee-c7020843f0.mp3",
    "glimmer planted their feet and puffed out a breath. a round cloud of gray smoke rolled over the bare ground. they peered through it, hunting for one orange flicker": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/glimmer-planted-their-feet-and-puffed-out-a-breath-a-round-cloud-of-gray-smoke-rolled-over-the-bare-ground-they-peered-through-it-hunting-for-one-orange-flicker-0728ab71d2.mp3",
    "glimmer ran three steps, opened their wings and glided past spark. this time, spark watched their breathing. the long, even breath continued after their feet touched the grass": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/glimmer-ran-three-steps-opened-their-wings-and-glided-past-spark-this-time-spark-watched-their-breathing-the-long-even-breath-continued-after-their-feet-touched-the-grass-caf17798f4.mp3",
    "glimmer sniffed spark's warm fingers. \"now you smell like cinnamon too.\" spark laughed and held out his hands again. this time, glimmer needed no chart": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/glimmer-sniffed-spark-s-warm-fingers-now-you-smell-like-cinnamon-too-spark-laughed-and-held-out-his-hands-again-this-time-glimmer-needed-no-chart-25ba60047c.mp3",
    "glimmer stared at the curled star, then stepped back from the table. blowing on the paper had made things worse. they needed to warm the sap underneath": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/glimmer-stared-at-the-curled-star-then-stepped-back-from-the-table-blowing-on-the-paper-had-made-things-worse-they-needed-to-warm-the-sap-underneath-2f3fdcb3e6.mp3",
    "glimmer stood in the bare practice patch between two piles of leaves. fern had left her seed pouch nearby. \"one flame,\" glimmer muttered, moving the leaves farther away": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/glimmer-stood-in-the-bare-practice-patch-between-two-piles-of-leaves-fern-had-left-her-seed-pouch-nearby-one-flame-glimmer-muttered-moving-the-leaves-farther-away-7f99d4fcb8.mp3",
    "glimmer took a slow breath and blew gently. one tiny orange flame burned steadily inside the circle, then faded before it touched any of the stones": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/glimmer-took-a-slow-breath-and-blew-gently-one-tiny-orange-flame-burned-steadily-inside-the-circle-then-faded-before-it-touched-any-of-the-stones-779f77279c.mp3",
    "glimmer touched the stiff edge and tried to lift the top star. it would not move. \"we need to separate them before class,\" they said": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/glimmer-touched-the-stiff-edge-and-tried-to-lift-the-top-star-it-would-not-move-we-need-to-separate-them-before-class-they-said-b2e6bfbc10.mp3",
