    "soon, a line of safe golden light wound through moonwood. lanterns and glowing mushrooms marked every turn. from the fire circle, glimmer watched the whole path brighten": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/soon-a-line-of-safe-golden-light-wound-through-moonwood-lanterns-and-glowing-mushrooms-marked-every-turn-from-the-fire-circle-glimmer-watched-the-whole-path-brighten-d15051b47e.mp3",
