    "spark began by covering three boards with arrows, numbers, and tiny flames. he explained each mark carefully, but glimmer's eyes grew wider as the lesson grew harder": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-began-by-covering-three-boards-with-arrows-numbers-and-tiny-flames-he-explained-each-mark-carefully-but-glimmer-s-eyes-grew-wider-as-the-lesson-grew-harder-4dc7270757.mp3",
    "spark cast his spell under the raised boot, then let his leg go loose. the boot stayed up. a thin curl of gold held it above the grass": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-cast-his-spell-under-the-raised-boot-then-let-his-leg-go-loose-the-boot-stayed-up-a-thin-curl-of-gold-held-it-above-the-grass-2a5a841f76.mp3",
    "spark cast the copy spell again, hoping the second hook might last longer. he counted without hanging the lantern. at ten, that hook vanished too": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-cast-the-copy-spell-again-hoping-the-second-hook-might-last-longer-he-counted-without-hanging-the-lantern-at-ten-that-hook-vanished-too-6e4ee2fcbd.mp3",
    "spark copied glimmer's pose and waved his arms with great care. golden sparkles lifted his hat, but both boots stayed firmly on the ground. 'almost,' spark said": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-copied-glimmer-s-pose-and-waved-his-arms-with-great-care-golden-sparkles-lifted-his-hat-but-both-boots-stayed-firmly-on-the-ground-almost-spark-said-031fd4aae5.mp3",
    "spark cupped his hands near glimmer's nose. \"that breath,\" he said. \"just like the glide.\" glimmer breathed out slowly, and cinnamon warmth filled the space between spark's palms": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-cupped-his-hands-near-glimmer-s-nose-that-breath-he-said-just-like-the-glide-glimmer-breathed-out-slowly-and-cinnamon-warmth-filled-the-space-between-spark-s-palms-f3ba9da7b3.mp3",
    "spark fetched leaves while wren measured the water for her wash. he carried the finished bowl carefully between both hands. his wand could wait by the stream": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-fetched-leaves-while-wren-measured-the-water-for-her-wash-he-carried-the-finished-bowl-carefully-between-both-hands-his-wand-could-wait-by-the-stream-23b81bd119.mp3",
    "spark hung the lantern on the new root-fiber hook, then counted aloud. \"ten, eleven, twelve!\" the hook stayed firm, and the lantern kept shining": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-hung-the-lantern-on-the-new-root-fiber-hook-then-counted-aloud-ten-eleven-twelve-the-hook-stayed-firm-and-the-lantern-kept-shining-f6b53061d1.mp3",
    "spark hung the waiting lantern from the glowing copied hook and began to count. for nine counts, the hook held firmly. luna watched from below": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-hung-the-waiting-lantern-from-the-glowing-copied-hook-and-began-to-count-for-nine-counts-the-hook-held-firmly-luna-watched-from-below-93face3586.mp3",
    "spark knelt beside a blue flower and rubbed its petals. the blue stayed. \"that was yellow,\" he said, just as another tickle climbed up his nose": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-knelt-beside-a-blue-flower-and-rubbed-its-petals-the-blue-stayed-that-was-yellow-he-said-just-as-another-tickle-climbed-up-his-nose-065b86c3b8.mp3",
    "spark laid his wand on the bank and knelt beside dewdrop. \"they're supposed to be silver,\" she said. spark swallowed and kept both hands away from his wand": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-laid-his-wand-on-the-bank-and-knelt-beside-dewdrop-they-re-supposed-to-be-silver-she-said-spark-swallowed-and-kept-both-hands-away-from-his-wand-7dc9a5b2a4.mp3",
    "spark offered to help glimmer make a steady warm breath. in return, glimmer would help test his floating spell. they shook hands and spread their lesson plans on the grass": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-offered-to-help-glimmer-make-a-steady-warm-breath-in-return-glimmer-would-help-test-his-floating-spell-they-shook-hands-and-spread-their-lesson-plans-on-the-grass-cfb9c53d1a.mp3",
    "spark raised his wand and copied the good hook in golden light. his copy spell always lasted exactly ten spoken counts. \"that is plenty,\" he said": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-raised-his-wand-and-copied-the-good-hook-in-golden-light-his-copy-spell-always-lasted-exactly-ten-spoken-counts-that-is-plenty-he-said-69851787c1.mp3",
    "spark sat down beside glimmer. \"when you glide, your breath goes out slowly,\" he said. \"show me again.\" glimmer spread their wings and backed toward the edge of the clearing": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-sat-down-beside-glimmer-when-you-glide-your-breath-goes-out-slowly-he-said-show-me-again-glimmer-spread-their-wings-and-backed-toward-the-edge-of-the-clearing-22bfe50f96.mp3",
    "spark squeezed his nose and tried to hold the sneeze inside. gold magic gathered around his watering eyes, growing brighter with every silent second": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-squeezed-his-nose-and-tried-to-hold-the-sneeze-inside-gold-magic-gathered-around-his-watering-eyes-growing-brighter-with-every-silent-second-9c5e09898b.mp3",
    "spark stood outside the bare patch and called, \"harder!\" glimmer blew until thick smoke rolled between the trees. both friends coughed and waved the smoke away": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-stood-outside-the-bare-patch-and-called-harder-glimmer-blew-until-thick-smoke-rolled-between-the-trees-both-friends-coughed-and-waved-the-smoke-away-717d9ce62c.mp3",
    "spark woke with a cold and a tickle deep inside his nose. because loose wand magic followed every sneeze, golden sparks already danced around him": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/spark-woke-with-a-cold-and-a-tickle-deep-inside-his-nose-because-loose-wand-magic-followed-every-sneeze-golden-sparks-already-danced-around-him-ec356c8391.mp3",
