    "wren checked the book once more and found an unused height charm below the mirrored line. this time, she read every mark before touching anything": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-checked-the-book-once-more-and-found-an-unused-height-charm-below-the-mirrored-line-this-time-she-read-every-mark-before-touching-anything-4ca1decc08.mp3",
    "wren climbed onto the open spell book and studied the shining marks again. a small arrow beside the words pointed in the opposite direction": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-climbed-onto-the-open-spell-book-and-studied-the-shining-marks-again-a-small-arrow-beside-the-words-pointed-in-the-opposite-direction-3a177b7ad3.mp3",
    "wren closed her spell book and knelt beside the mushroom. 'can you show us the open meadow?' she asked. its bright side pulsed as if answering": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-closed-her-spell-book-and-knelt-beside-the-mushroom-can-you-show-us-the-open-meadow-she-asked-its-bright-side-pulsed-as-if-answering-1207eaca4c.mp3",
    "wren decided to pour it anyway. one flower straightened, leaned toward the path, and tugged its roots out of the soil. fern stared as it began walking": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-decided-to-pour-it-anyway-one-flower-straightened-leaned-toward-the-path-and-tugged-its-roots-out-of-the-soil-fern-stared-as-it-began-walking-5b3954e29e.mp3",
    "wren dripped the wash into the stream. spark carried another bowlful to the blue flowers and rinsed their petals. silver fish flashed through the clear water again": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-dripped-the-wash-into-the-stream-spark-carried-another-bowlful-to-the-blue-flowers-and-rinsed-their-petals-silver-fish-flashed-through-the-clear-water-again-ba9a354b0a.mp3",
    "wren followed the arrow from the silver moon. halfway across, the page curled beneath her feet. she slid back toward the spine before she could read the last word": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-followed-the-arrow-from-the-silver-moon-halfway-across-the-page-curled-beneath-her-feet-she-slid-back-toward-the-spine-before-she-could-read-the-last-word-891c524936.mp3",
    "wren followed the berry trail and gathered the other nine onto a broad leaf. none had rolled away. as she lifted the leaf, wren had a new idea": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-followed-the-berry-trail-and-gathered-the-other-nine-onto-a-broad-leaf-none-had-rolled-away-as-she-lifted-the-leaf-wren-had-a-new-idea-c2e839e22a.mp3",
    "wren hurried between the waiting plants and sprinkled them with stream water. one by one, they walked back toward the holes they had left in the garden": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-hurried-between-the-waiting-plants-and-sprinkled-them-with-stream-water-one-by-one-they-walked-back-toward-the-holes-they-had-left-in-the-garden-c8376d1826.mp3",
    "wren opened her book and searched for an answer, but the wandering plants kept leaving. fern hurried after them, calling each plant by its name": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-opened-her-book-and-searched-for-an-answer-but-the-wandering-plants-kept-leaving-fern-hurried-after-them-calling-each-plant-by-its-name-4e5193bb85.mp3",
    "wren opened her magic pocket beside the ten berries. \"i'll carry them inside before the rain grows heavy,\" she promised. fern nodded as the dark clouds thickened": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-opened-her-magic-pocket-beside-the-ten-berries-i-ll-carry-them-inside-before-the-rain-grows-heavy-she-promised-fern-nodded-as-the-dark-clouds-thickened-6ced667b2c.mp3",
    "wren placed the first moonberry inside, then added another and another. the pocket still felt completely light. she hurried toward hollow oak without looking behind her": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-placed-the-first-moonberry-inside-then-added-another-and-another-the-pocket-still-felt-completely-light-she-hurried-toward-hollow-oak-without-looking-behind-her-8f6ad27d06.mp3",
    "wren placed the tenth berry beside the other nine. then she folded the broad leaf around all ten and tied it shut. \"now they are one bundle.\"": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-placed-the-tenth-berry-beside-the-other-nine-then-she-folded-the-broad-leaf-around-all-ten-and-tied-it-shut-now-they-are-one-bundle-7ff6fab82b.mp3",
    "wren pressed one ear against the wall beside him. the scratching moved from root to root, followed by quiet muttering that neither friend could understand": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-pressed-one-ear-against-the-wall-beside-him-the-scratching-moved-from-root-to-root-followed-by-quiet-muttering-that-neither-friend-could-understand-d3d174fa7d.mp3",
    "wren put the green and purple recipes in separate books. \"next time, show me before you pour,\" said fern. wren nodded and wiped purple drops from the path": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-put-the-green-and-purple-recipes-in-separate-books-next-time-show-me-before-you-pour-said-fern-wren-nodded-and-wiped-purple-drops-from-the-path-ea83528988.mp3",
    "wren put the spell away and opened a book about building a step stool. \"four legs,\" she read. \"at least those stay the same size.\"": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-put-the-spell-away-and-opened-a-book-about-building-a-step-stool-four-legs-she-read-at-least-those-stay-the-same-size-2365f42cba.mp3",
    "wren rushed to try the spell before checking both ends of the line. she began at the wrong moon mark, and blue light filled the room": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-rushed-to-try-the-spell-before-checking-both-ends-of-the-line-she-began-at-the-wrong-moon-mark-and-blue-light-filled-the-room-35bbb173df.mp3",
    "wren shut her book and followed the scattered racers. at each confusing turn, she laid bright leaves pointing toward home. she had stopped thinking about winning": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-shut-her-book-and-followed-the-scattered-racers-at-each-confusing-turn-she-laid-bright-leaves-pointing-toward-home-she-had-stopped-thinking-about-winning-a002f20151.mp3",
    "wren slipped the single leaf bundle into her magic pocket. this time, nothing popped out behind her. she hurried to hollow oak as the rain fell harder": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-slipped-the-single-leaf-bundle-into-her-magic-pocket-this-time-nothing-popped-out-behind-her-she-hurried-to-hollow-oak-as-the-rain-fell-harder-c0a0055919.mp3",
    "wren tapped her pocket and cast a familiar spell. the pocket could hold one object without any weight. she smiled, certain ten little berries would fit": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/wren-tapped-her-pocket-and-cast-a-familiar-spell-the-pocket-could-hold-one-object-without-any-weight-she-smiled-certain-ten-little-berries-would-fit-5475a45a78.mp3",
    "young owls hooted outside the round door, ready for their lesson. luna had only a few minutes to restore the mobile. she began with a tidy plan": "/audio/production/en-US/guided_page/young-owls-hooted-outside-the-round-door-ready-for-their-lesson-luna-had-only-a-few-minutes-to-restore-the-mobile-she-began-with-a-tidy-plan-fa704d393b.mp3",
